WEBVTT

00:05:57.517 --> 00:06:00.046
that would not be possible without access to the eye,

00:06:00.046 --> 00:06:01.981
and that clip-on device can be manufactured

00:06:01.981 --> 00:06:03.531
for just a few dollars,

00:06:03.531 --> 00:06:05.162
and people can be cured of blindness,

00:06:05.162 --> 00:06:08.385
and I think it says a lot about us as a human race

00:06:08.385 --> 00:06:10.910
if we've developed cures and we don't deliver them.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.108
But now we can.

00:06:12.108 --> 00:06:14.324
Thank you.

00:06:14.324 --> 00:06:16.488
(Applause)